{
  "_why": "Committed demo data for assets/derivation-viewer.html, per report-viewer standard C2 (the screenshot must be reproducible) and C3 (the demo must show the failure the plugin exists for). Two failures are shown deliberately: four tokens that would have been set from screenshot evidence alone, and a primary action colour that passes AA only for large text. Both are the shapes a design system ships without noticing. The appearance mode is carried per pair because this fixture mixes light-mode and dark-mode pairs, and color-system.md names a mode-less contrast table as the shape of the error that hides a role behaving differently in the two modes -- an error the first version of this very fixture committed.",
